    G --&gt; CR["Creation&lt;br/&gt;new value that did not exist before"]
    G --&gt; SU["Substitution&lt;br/&gt;value moved from another surface, channel or SKU"]
    G --&gt; TD["Temporal displacement&lt;br/&gt;value pulled forward or backward in time"]
